{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/grype/pulls/2886","id":2763812559,"node_id":"PR_kwDOD-rsp86kvG7P","html_url":"https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/2886","diff_url":"https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/2886.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/anchore/grype/pull/2886.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/grype/issues/2886","number":2886,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(grype/matcher): use unaffected match table to remove appropriate vulns","user":{"login":"crosleyzack","id":4088903,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwODg5MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4088903?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crosleyzack","html_url":"https://github.com/crosleyzack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crosleyzack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crosleyzack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crosleyzack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crosleyzack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crosleyzack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crosleyzack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crosleyzack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crosleyzack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crosleyzack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Removes vulnerabilities from output based on entries in the unaffected tables for the specific package-version. This allows for vulnerabilities identified in a scan target to be removed if remedied by some mechanism, such as a vendor specific package.\r\n\r\nIn the example below, you can see this operation on a chainguard version of aiohttp which has vulnerability `GHSA-5h86-8mv2-jq9f` in version `3.9.1` but is fixed in the chainguard built `3.9.1+cgr.1` \r\n\r\nExample: \r\n\r\n```\r\n➜ GRYPE_DB_AUTO_UPDATE=\"false\" go run cmd/grype/main.go ../aiohttp\r\n ✔ Indexed file system                                                                                                                                       ../aiohttp\r\n ✔ Cataloged contents                                                                                  596d41bfa3b99862cbd633642d86a058940190a7f9d4733b759e8702a03f815d\r\n   ├── ✔ Packages                        [10 packages]\r\n   ├── ✔ Executables                     [8 executables]\r\n   ├── ✔ File metadata                   [26 locations]\r\n   └── ✔ File digests                    [26 files]\r\n ✔ Scanned for vulnerabilities     [6 vulnerability matches]\r\n   ├── by severity: 0 critical, 2 high, 3 medium, 1 low, 0 negligible\r\n   └── by status:   6 fixed, 0 not-fixed, 0 ignored [0000]  WARN no explicit name and version provided for directory source, deriving artifact ID from the given path (whi\r\nNAME     INSTALLED  FIXED IN  TYPE    VULNERABILITY        SEVERITY  EPSS  RISK\r\naiohttp  3.9.1      3.9.2     python  GHSA-5h86-8mv2-jq9f  High      N/A   N/A\r\naiohttp  3.9.1      3.9.4     python  GHSA-5m98-qgg9-wh84  High      N/A   N/A\r\naiohttp  3.9.1      3.9.4     python  GHSA-7gpw-8wmc-pm8g  Medium    N/A   N/A\r\naiohttp  3.9.1      3.10.11   python  GHSA-8495-4g3g-x7pr  Medium    N/A   N/A\r\naiohttp  3.9.1      3.9.2     python  GHSA-8qpw-xqxj-h4r2  Medium    N/A   N/A\r\naiohttp  3.9.1      3.12.14   python  GHSA-9548-qrrj-x5pj  Low       N/A   N/A\r\n\r\n➜ GRYPE_DB_AUTO_UPDATE=\"false\" go run cmd/grype/main.go ../aiohttp+cgr1\r\n ✔ Indexed file system                                                                                                                                  ../aiohttp+cgr1\r\n ✔ Cataloged contents                                                                                  c0671a3ff6ef54e92fe828891e0b10e2082fe31447d8fba15f0ed9bf2638f220\r\n   ├── ✔ Packages                        [9 packages]\r\n   ├── ✔ Executables                     [8 executables]\r\n   ├── ✔ File metadata                   [25 locations]\r\n   └── ✔ File digests                    [25 files]\r\n ✔ Scanned for vulnerabilities     [5 vulnerability matches]\r\n   ├── by severity: 0 critical, 1 high, 3 medium, 1 low, 0 negligible\r\n   └── by status:   5 fixed, 0 not-fixed, 0 ignored [0000]  WARN no explicit name and version provided for directory source, deriving artifact ID from the given path (whi\r\nNAME     INSTALLED    FIXED IN  TYPE    VULNERABILITY        SEVERITY  EPSS  RISK\r\naiohttp  3.9.1+cgr.1  3.9.4     python  GHSA-5m98-qgg9-wh84  High      N/A   N/A\r\naiohttp  3.9.1+cgr.1  3.9.4     python  GHSA-7gpw-8wmc-pm8g  Medium    N/A   N/A\r\naiohttp  3.9.1+cgr.1  3.10.11   python  GHSA-8495-4g3g-x7pr  Medium    N/A   N/A\r\naiohttp  3.9.1+cgr.1  3.9.2     python  GHSA-8qpw-xqxj-h4r2  Medium    N/A   N/A\r\naiohttp  3.9.1+cgr.1  3.12.14   python  GHSA-9548-qrrj-x5pj  Low       N/A   N/A\r\n\r\n\r\n```","created_at":"2025-08-21T17:47:49Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T21:36:09Z","closed_at":"2025-09-08T20:20:58Z","merged_at":"2025-09-08T20:20:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"8a04a093eeb2903d1692239a1c14fdc7fda5f5fb","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":2089041565,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDg5MDQxNTY1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/grype/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request"}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/grype/pulls/2886/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/grype/pulls/2886/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/grype/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/grype/issues/2886/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anchore/grype/statuses/2e6cc39514daa44a2d1a4910367256e0242c20b2","head":{"label":"crosleyzack:crosley/add-ignores-